on exitFrame
  [  0] pushcons 0 .............................. <"done">
  [  2] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [  3] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [  4] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [  5] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [  6] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [  9] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 10] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 11] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 12] pushvarref 1 ............................ <meetings>
  [ 14] putchunk 18 ............................. put "done" into item 2 of meetings
  [ 16] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 19] getglobal 17 ............................ <cdsavepath>
  [ 21] pushcons 8 .............................. <"sabmon2.dir">
  [ 23] joinstr ................................. <cdsavepath & "sabmon2.dir">
  [ 24] pusharglistnoret 2 ...................... <1, cdsavepath & "sabmon2.dir">
  [ 26] extcall 2 ............................... go(1, cdsavepath & "sabmon2.dir")
  [ 28] ret
end
